{"id":"NCT07464821","title":"National Multicentre Study on Lipid Profile in Noonan Syndrome and Related Disorders: Trends by Age, Gender and Genotype","official":"National Multicentre Study on Lipid Profile in Noonan Syndrome and Related Disorders: Trends by Age, Gender and Genotype","summary":"RASopathies, including Noonan syndrome, involve dysmorphisms, metabolic alterations, and an unfavorable lipid profile. This study investigates lipid and glucose metabolism to improve patient care.","conditions":["RASopathies","Noonan Syndrome"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Clinically diagnosed RASopathy confirmed by molecular testing;\n* Patients referred to participating centers between 01/01/2001 and 31/12/2022;\n* Age at enrollment between 2 and 35 years, inclusive;\n* Obtaining informed consent.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* None.","minAge":"2 Years","maxAge":"35 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":200,"start":"2025-02-26","pcd":"2027-02-26","upd":"2026-03-11","sponsor":"IRCCS Azienda Ospedaliero-Universitaria di Bologna","areas":["other","rare"],"central":["Federica Tamburrino · 00390512143723 · federica.tamburrino@aosp.bo.it"],"sites":[{"f":"Azienda Ospedaliero-Universitaria di Alessandria","city":"Alessandria","pr":"","zip":"","s":"NYR","lat":44.9092,"lon":8.6101,"c":"Andrea Secco · asecco@ospedale.al.it"},{"f":"AOU Policlinico di Bari","city":"Bari","pr":"","zip":"","s":"NYR","lat":41.1207,"lon":16.8698,"c":"Maria Felicia Faienza · mariafelicia.faienza@uniba.it"},{"f":"IRCCS Azienda Ospedaliero-Universitaria di Bologna","city":"Bologna","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":44.4938,"lon":11.3387,"c":"Federica Tamburrino · 00390512143723 · federica.tamburrino@aosp.bo.it"},{"f":"AOU Meyer IRCCS","city":"Florence","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":43.7792,"lon":11.2463,"c":"Stefano Stagi · stefano.stagi@unifi.it"},{"f":"IRCCS Istituto Giannina Gaslini","city":"Genova","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":45.21